---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = false;
---

<Layout 
  title="À Propos | La Vision WattCharge"
  description="Découvrez comment WattCharge réinvente la recharge électrique : circuits directs, technologie connectée de pointe et sécurité sans compromis au meilleur prix."
  headerMode="dark"
>
  <!-- Interactive Particle Canvas Background -->
  <canvas id="electric-canvas" class="electric-canvas"></canvas>

  <!-- Cyber grid overlay -->
  <div class="cyber-grid-bg"></div>

  <!-- Hero Section avec image de fond futuriste + Parallax -->
  <section class="about-hero-section">
    <div class="about-hero-img-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container about-hero-container">
      <div class="hero-badge-wrapper scroll-reveal">
        <span class="badge-certified"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt-lightning text-gradient-electric"></i> Le Manifeste WattCharge</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="about-main-title scroll-reveal">
        RÉINVENTER LA RECHARGE.<br />
        <span class="text-glow-neon">LIBÉRER LA ROUTE.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="about-lead-text scroll-reveal">
        Nous éliminons les intermédiaires pour proposer des bornes connectées haut de gamme, sécurisées et conformes directement de l'usine à votre garage.
      </p>
      
      <!-- Interactive Scroll Indicator -->
      <div class="scroll-indicator-wrapper">
        <span>Découvrir la Révolution</span>
        <div class="scroll-mouse">
          <div class="scroll-wheel"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section Manifeste / Vision -->
  <section class="about-vision-section">
    <div class="container vision-grid">
      <div class="vision-left scroll-reveal">
        <div class="vision-header">
          <span class="small-tag text-gradient-electric">Notre Engagement</span>
          <h2>NOTRE VISION</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lead-paragraph">
          La transition vers la mobilité électrique ne devrait pas être freinée par des barrières tarifaires artificielles ou des installations complexes surfacturées.
        </p>
        <p>
          Chez WattCharge, nous avons fait un constat simple : les réseaux d'installateurs traditionnels importent les mêmes bornes, ajoutent des marges exorbitantes et revendent des packs d'installation à plus de 1500 €. 
        </p>
        <p>
          En adoptant un modèle **100% E-commerce Direct**, nous sourçons nos bornes auprès des plus grands fabricants mondiaux (conception Feyree haut de gamme), intégrons nativement les protections électriques obligatoires RCD DC 6mA, et vous expédions le colis gratuitement en 24/48h. Vous êtes libre de confier la pose à l'électricien de votre choix, ou de la poser vous-même, en économisant jusqu'à 60% sur le budget global.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="vision-right scroll-reveal">
        <div class="vision-pillars-box glass-panel glow-panel-teal">
          <div class="hud-scanner-overlay"></div>
          <h3>Les 3 Piliers de notre Révolution</h3>
          
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i></div>
            <div>
              <h4>Technologie WiFi Native</h4>
              <p>Toutes nos bornes intègrent le WiFi Tuya Smart Life. Pas d'options payantes pour planifier vos charges en heures creuses.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div>
            <div>
              <h4>Sécurité Totale RCD DC 6mA</h4>
              <p>Protection contre les fuites de courant continu intégrée directement dans le boîtier. Conforme NF C 15-100 sans surcoût.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake-slash"></i></div>
            <div>
              <h4>Zéro Intermédiaire</h4>
              <p>Pas de force de vente, pas de réseau d'installateurs franchisés à rémunérer. Un prix usine net et transparent.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section Chiffres Clés (Stats HUD avec compteurs animés) -->
  <section class="about-stats-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card glass-panel hover-scale scroll-reveal" data-stat-card>
          <strong class="stat-number text-gradient-electric" data-target="-60">-0%</strong>
          <span>D'économie sur le budget global de recharge à domicile</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card glass-panel hover-scale scroll-reveal" data-stat-card>
          <strong class="stat-number" data-target="100">0%</strong>
          <span>Bornes connectées WiFi & configurables via application</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card glass-panel hover-scale scroll-reveal" data-stat-card>
          <strong class="stat-number text-gradient-electric" data-target="6">0mA</strong>
          <span>Détection active intégrée des fuites de courant continu</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card glass-panel hover-scale scroll-reveal" data-stat-card>
          <strong class="stat-number" data-target="48">0h</strong>
          <span>Délai moyen d'expédition depuis nos entrepôts européens</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section DNA / Processus de Livraison Sourcing avec ligne laser animée au scroll -->
  <section class="about-process-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="process-header scroll-reveal text-center">
        <span class="small-tag text-gradient-electric">Transparence Totale</span>
        <h2>NOTRE CHAINE DE VALEUR DIRECTE</h2>
        <p class="process-sub">Du fabricant à votre tableau électrique, sans friction</p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-timeline-wrapper">
        <!-- Glowing laser line -->
        <div class="timeline-laser-line">
          <div class="laser-fill" id="laser-fill"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="process-steps">
          <div class="process-step-card scroll-reveal">
            <div class="step-num-badge">01</div>
            <h3>Sourcing Direct Usine</h3>
            <p>
              Nous travaillons main dans la main avec le fabricant leader Feyree pour produire des bornes connectées dotées de puces WiFi intelligentes et de lecteurs RFID.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step-card scroll-reveal">
            <div class="step-num-badge">02</div>
            <h3>Contrôle Qualité CE</h3>
            <p>
              Chaque lot de production est soumis à des tests rigoureux de résistance aux surtensions et de détection de courant de fuite DC 6mA.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step-card scroll-reveal">
            <div class="step-num-badge">03</div>
            <h3>Stockage en Europe</h3>
            <p>
              Les bornes sont stockées dans nos entrepôts en Espagne, Pologne et Allemagne pour assurer un transit douanier nul et une livraison express.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="process-step-card scroll-reveal">
            <div class="step-num-badge">04</div>
            <h3>Expédition Gratuite 48h</h3>
            <p>
              Dès validation de votre paiement, l'ordre d'envoi est transmis. Vous recevez par e-mail votre numéro de suivi DHL / GLS sous 24h.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA de fin avec effet de glow dynamique -->
  <section class="about-cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-cta-box glass-panel glow-panel-teal text-center scroll-reveal">
        <div class="hud-scanner-overlay"></div>
        <h2>Prêt à passer à la vitesse supérieure ?</h2>
        <p>Commandez votre borne intelligente WattCharge aujourd'hui et commencez à économiser dès la première recharge.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="/boutique" class="btn-primary cyber-btn">Découvrir le catalogue <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  // 1. Interactive Particle Canvas Background (Wow effect)
  const canvas = document.getElementById('electric-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
  if (canvas) {
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
    let width = (canvas.width = window.innerWidth);
    let height = (canvas.height = window.innerHeight);

    // Particles array
    const particles: Array<{
      x: number;
      y: number;
      vx: number;
      vy: number;
      radius: number;
    }> = [];

    const particleCount = 45;
    const connectionDist = 120;

    // Create particles
    for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {
      particles.push({
        x: Math.random() * width,
        y: Math.random() * height,
        vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.8,
        vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.8,
        radius: Math.random() * 2 + 1,
      });
    }

    // Mouse coords
    let mouse = { x: -1000, y: -1000 };
    window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
      mouse.x = e.clientX;
      mouse.y = e.clientY;
    });

    window.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
      mouse.x = -1000;
      mouse.y = -1000;
    });

    window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
      width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;
      height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;
    });

    function draw() {
      if (!ctx) return;
      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);

      // Draw connections
      for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {
        const p1 = particles[i];
        
        // Link to mouse
        const mDist = Math.hypot(p1.x - mouse.x, p1.y - mouse.y);
        if (mDist < 180) {
          ctx.beginPath();
          ctx.moveTo(p1.x, p1.y);
          ctx.lineTo(mouse.x, mouse.y);
          ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(83, 183, 168, ${0.15 * (1 - mDist / 180)})`;
          ctx.lineWidth = 1;
          ctx.stroke();
        }

        for (let j = i + 1; j < particles.length; j++) {
          const p2 = particles[j];
          const dist = Math.hypot(p1.x - p2.x, p1.y - p2.y);

          if (dist < connectionDist) {
            ctx.beginPath();
            ctx.moveTo(p1.x, p1.y);
            ctx.lineTo(p2.x, p2.y);
            ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(83, 183, 168, ${0.18 * (1 - dist / connectionDist)})`;
            ctx.lineWidth = 0.8;
            ctx.stroke();
          }
        }
      }

      // Draw dots
      for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {
        const p = particles[i];
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);
        ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(83, 183, 168, 0.4)';
        ctx.fill();

        // Move
        p.x += p.vx;
        p.y += p.vy;

        // Bound check
        if (p.x < 0 || p.x > width) p.vx *= -1;
        if (p.y < 0 || p.y > height) p.vy *= -1;
      }

      requestAnimationFrame(draw);
    }

    draw();
  }

  // 2. Count-up Stats Anim (Wow effect)
  const statCards = document.querySelectorAll('[data-stat-card]');
  
  const statObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        const numEl = entry.target.querySelector('.stat-number') as HTMLElement;
        if (numEl && !numEl.classList.contains('counted')) {
          numEl.classList.add('counted');
          const target = parseInt(numEl.getAttribute('data-target') || '0');
          const isNegative = target < 0;
          const absTarget = Math.abs(target);
          let current = 0;
          const duration = 1500; // ms
          const stepTime = Math.max(Math.floor(duration / absTarget), 15);
          
          const suffix = numEl.textContent?.includes('mA') ? 'mA' : numEl.textContent?.includes('h') ? 'h' : '%';
          
          const timer = setInterval(() => {
            current += Math.ceil(absTarget / 30);
            if (current >= absTarget) {
              current = absTarget;
              clearInterval(timer);
            }
            numEl.textContent = `${isNegative ? '-' : ''}${current}${suffix}`;
          }, stepTime);
        }
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.2 });

  statCards.forEach(card => statObserver.observe(card));

  // 3. Scroll Reveal with 3D translation effect
  const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.scroll-reveal');

  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        entry.target.classList.add('visible');
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.1 });

  revealElements.forEach(el => observer.observe(el));

  // 4. Scroll driven timeline laser fill
  const laserFill = document.getElementById('laser-fill');
  const processSection = document.querySelector('.about-process-section');

  if (laserFill && processSection) {
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      const rect = processSection.getBoundingClientRect();
      const sectionHeight = rect.height;
      // Calculate how far the section has scrolled relative to viewport center
      const scrolled = window.innerHeight / 2 - rect.top;
      const pct = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, (scrolled / (sectionHeight - 200)) * 100));
      laserFill.style.height = `${pct}%`;
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  /* Interactive Particle Canvas style */
  .electric-canvas {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Cyber Grid Background style */
  .cyber-grid-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(83, 183, 168, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(83, 183, 168, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 50px 50px;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Hero Section style */
  .about-hero-section {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 260px;
    padding-bottom: 160px;
    background-image: url('/images/about_hero_car.png');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: scroll;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .about-hero-img-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96) 100%);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .about-hero-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .about-main-title {
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-main-title {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
    }
  }

  .text-glow-neon {
    color: #ffffff;
    text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(83, 183, 168, 0.6);
  }

  .about-lead-text {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    max-width: 720px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Scroll indicator */
  .scroll-indicator-wrapper {
    margin-top: 60px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .scroll-mouse {
    width: 24px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
    position: relative;
  }

  .scroll-wheel {
    width: 4px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--accent-teal);
    border-radius: 2px;
    position: absolute;
    top: 6px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    animation: scrollWheel 1.5s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes scrollWheel {
    0% { transform: translate(-50%, 0); opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: translate(-50%, 12px); opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* Vision Section */
  .about-vision-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .vision-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .vision-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 50px;
    }
  }

  .vision-left h2 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .small-tag {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .vision-left p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .vision-left p strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .vision-pillars-box {
    padding: 40px;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 30px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* HUD scanner line on cards */
  .hud-scanner-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(83, 183, 168, 0) 93%, rgba(83, 183, 168, 0.1) 96%, rgba(83, 183, 168, 0) 100%);
    background-size: 100% 30px;
    animation: scanHUD 5s linear infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @keyframes scanHUD {
    0% { background-position: 0 -300px; }
    100% { background-position: 0 900px; }
  }

  .vision-pillars-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .pillar-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(83, 183, 168, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(83, 183, 168, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent-teal);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .pillar-icon i {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .pillar-item h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .pillar-item p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Stats Section */
  .about-stats-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 40px 30px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .stat-card span {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Process / Sourcing Section */
  .about-process-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: #ffffff;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .process-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 70px;
  }

  .process-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .process-sub {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Timeline Laser line layout */
  .process-timeline-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    padding: 20px 0;
  }

  .timeline-laser-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 4px;
    background: var(--border-color);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .timeline-laser-line {
      left: 30px;
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  .laser-fill {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 0%; /* Scrolled dynamically */
    background: var(--gradient-electric);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-teal);
    transition: height 0.1s ease-out;
  }

  .process-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 60px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .process-step-card {
    width: 45%;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 35px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  /* Alternate left/right columns */
  .process-step-card:nth-child(odd) {
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .process-step-card:nth-child(even) {
    align-self: flex-end;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .process-step-card {
      width: calc(100% - 70px);
      align-self: flex-end !important;
    }
  }

  .step-num-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gradient-electric);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
    z-index: 10;
  }

  /* Badge positioning relative to timeline */
  .process-step-card:nth-child(odd) .step-num-badge {
    right: -22px;
    transform: translateX(50%);
  }

  .process-step-card:nth-child(even) .step-num-badge {
    left: -22px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .process-step-card .step-num-badge {
      left: -52px !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }

  .process-step-card h3 {
